<BaseLayout title="Privacy and cookies" description="Privacy and cookies" lang="en" alternateEn="/privacy/" alternatePt="/pt/privacidade/">
<section class="wrap" style="padding:4rem 1.25rem;max-width:760px"><h1>Privacy and cookies</h1><p>We use optional Google Analytics and Microsoft Clarity only after you allow analytics. Clarity receives interaction data and technical browser information to help us improve the website. Advertising storage remains denied. Your preference is stored in your browser for up to 180 days. Use Cookie preferences in the footer to change it and stop future recording. Contact Antonio at atnguide@hotmail.com about your data. Hosting and security are provided by Cloudflare. WhatsApp handles messages you choose to send under its own privacy terms.</p><ClarityAnalytics project="" hosts="" language="en" disclosureOnly /></section>
</BaseLayout>
